    "_X5_note": "Validation content is where code earns trust. BODY claims to work. Cv proves it — or exposes the lie. Every assertion is a covenant: this function promises this behavior, and the test holds it accountable.",
    "_X5_scripture": "1 Thessalonians 5:21 — Prove all things; hold fast that which is good."
}
